>
<div class="sd">
<section class="sd__hero shell">
  <span class="sd__kick reveal"><i></i>Services</span>
  <h1 class="sd__h1 reveal">Drone <span style="color:#ffd200">footage.</span></h1>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1">We treat aerials as <b>part of the film</b>, not decoration – we fly when the shot from above genuinely adds something to the edit.</p>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1">We shoot drone photo and video for investments, industry, automotive, events and brand material. The flight plan is set together with the shooting plan.</p>
  <div class="sd__facts reveal" data-d="2">
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Scope</span><strong>Aerial video and photo</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Gear</span><strong>Owned, 4K</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Flights</span><strong>Fully compliant</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Base</span><strong>Gdańsk · all of Poland</strong></div>
  </div>
  <figure class="sd__reel reveal" data-d="1">
    <img src="/assets/optimized/lcp/pruszcz-park-4-4b252b80-1280.webp" srcset="/assets/optimized/lcp/pruszcz-park-4-4b252b80-800.webp 800w, /assets/optimized/lcp/pruszcz-park-4-4b252b80-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="100vw" width="1280" height="760" alt="Pruszcz Park" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
    <figcaption><b>Pruszcz Park</b><span>Aerial footage / investment</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
<div class="sd__body shell">
  <div>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-zakres">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>What we film</h2></div>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Property &amp; investments</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>We show the scale of an investment, estate, plant or plot – from construction progress to the finished building in its surroundings.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Housing estates</span><span>Construction progress</span><span>Development land</span><span>Plants and halls</span><span>Premium property</span><span>Site context</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Automotive</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Driving shots, fly-overs and model presentations – frames that build a premium look for the brand.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Driving shots</span><span>Fly-over</span><span>Model presentation</span><span>Showroom and yard</span><span>Automotive events</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Events</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>We capture the scale of an event from the air: the crowd, the stage and the space you cannot see from the ground.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Aerial aftermovie</span><span>Festivals</span><span>Trade fairs</span><span>Sports events</span><span>Concerts</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Industry &amp; infrastructure</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>We document plants, ports, infrastructure and installations – for brand material and visual inspection.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Manufacturing plants</span><span>Port and logistics</span><span>Road infrastructure</span><span>Solar farms</span><span>Visual inspection</span></div></div></details>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-proces">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>How we work</h2></div>
      <div class="sd__steps">
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Scouting</h3><p>We check the location, airspace and flying conditions.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Permits</h3><p>We settle zones, clearances and safety rules.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Flight</h3><p>Fly-overs, push-ins, reveals and frames prepared for the edit.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Aerial stills</h3><p>Aerial photography for sales material and the website.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Into the edit</h3><p>Footage ready to cut together with film and social media.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-work">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>Selected work</h2></div>
      <div class="sd__work">
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=video#pt-grid"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/portfolio/doraco-tvp/doraco-hala-zdjeciowa-tvp-zdjecia-z-drona-02.jpg" alt="DORACO – TVP studio · Aerial" loading="lazy" /></div><span>TVP studio · Aerial</span><h3>DORACO ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=video#pt-grid"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/work/landrover.jpg" alt="Land Rover – Automotive · Off-road" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Automotive · Off-road</span><h3>Land Rover ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/realizacja/?v=tvTuMX3mxG4"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/work/baltic-robert-3.avif" alt="Baltic Towers – Investment · Video" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Investment · Video</span><h3>Baltic Towers ↗</h3></a>
      </div>
      <div class="sd__more reveal">
        <a class="is-lead" href="/en/portfolio-en/#pt-grid">Full portfolio ↗</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=video#pt-grid">Video</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=animacje#pt-grid">Animation</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=eventy#pt-grid">Events</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid">Graphics</a>
